#: temp.glade:366
msgid "PTXprint: Create List"
msgstr "PTXprint: Kamapim Lista"

#: temp.glade:466 temp.glade:2907
msgid "MAT MRK LUK JHN ACT ROM 1CO 2CO GAL EPH PHP COL 1TH 2TH 1TI 2TI TIT"
msgstr "MAT MRK LUK JHN ACT ROM 1CO 2CO GAL EPH PHP COL 1TH 2TH 1TI 2TI TIT"

#: temp.glade:478
msgid "Add Syllable-Based Hyphenated Words"
msgstr "Putim ol Hyphenated Wod Bilong Syllable"

#: temp.glade:483
msgid "This advanced hybrid option is only available if \n"
"Syllable Line Breaking has been enabled under \n"
"Additional Script Settings for Complex Scripts.\n"
"\n"
"If enabled, it will use Syllable Line Breaking to\n"
"hyphenate words from the books selected\n"
"so that a combination of manually-marked\n"
"hyphenation along with automated\n"
"hyphenation is possible."
msgstr "Dispela advanced hybrid option i stap tasol sapos \n"
"Syllable Line Breaking i op long \n"
"Additional Script Settings bilong Complex Scripts.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos i op, bai em i usim Syllable Line Breaking long\n"
"brukim hyphen long ol wod bilong ol buk yu makim\n"
"bai yu ken usim hyphen yu makim wantaim\n"
"hyphen bilong kompiuta."

#: temp.glade:516
msgid "Limit Hyphenation List to Words Found in:"
msgstr "Limitim Hyphenation Lis long ol Wod i Stap long:"

#: temp.glade:521
msgid "Normally ALL hyphenated words from ALL books\n"
"are included in PTXprint's hyphenated wordlist.\n"
"\n"
"However, if the list of hyphenated words is too long\n"
"(greater than 63929 words) then you can prioritize\n"
"which words to include by enabling this option to\n"
"only use words from the books being printed.\n"
"\n"
"Note that if there are too many words in the Paratext\n"
"hyphenation file, PTXprint will automatically prioritize\n"
"the list created for XeTeX based on frequency."
msgstr "Olgeta hyphenated wod bilong olgeta buk\n"
"i stap long hyphenated wod lis bilong PTXprint.\n"
"\n"
"Tasol sapos lis bilong ol hyphenated wod i longpela tumas\n"
"(i winim 63929 wod), yu ken makim ol wod yu laikim\n"
"bilong putim long lis. Yu ken opim dispela seting\n"
"bilong usim ol wod tasol long ol buk i go long print.\n"
"\n"
"Harim: sapos planti tumas wod i stap long Paratext\n"
"hyphenation fail, PTXprint bai makim yet ol wod\n"
"long lis bilong XeTeX, long hamas taim ol i kamap."

#: temp.glade:542
msgid "Only Use Approved Hyphenation Words"
msgstr "Usim Tasol Ol Hyphenation Wod Ol i Orait Pinis"

#: temp.glade:547
msgid "The Paratext WordList tool guesses hyphenation points\n"
"based on syllable structure and patterns in the language.\n"
"\n"
"However, it expects the user to (i) check and, if appropriate,\n"
"(ii) approve the suggested hyphenation points (by clicking\n"
"the check mark making it appear green).\n"
"\n"
"Normally only the approved hyphenated words will be used\n"
"when creating the hyphenation list for PTXprint/TeX to use.\n"
"\n"
"However, if you wish to include ALL words (regardless of\n"
"their approval status) then disable this option."
msgstr "Paratext WordList tul i givim tingting long ol hyphenation poin\n"
"bilong ol syllable na paten bilong tok ples.\n"
"\n"
"Tasol em i laikim yusa i (i) skelim na sapos i orait,\n"
"(ii) oraitim ol poin ol i singautim (long klikim\n"
"sain tik na em i kamap grin).\n"
"\n"
"Olgeta taim ol hyphenated wod ol i oraitim tasol\n"
"bai i go long hyphenation lis bilong PTXprint/TeX.\n"
"\n"
"Tasol sapos yu laik putim OLGETA wod (maski ol i oraitim\n"
"o nogat), pasim dispela seting."

#: temp.glade:583 temp.glade:601
msgid "Do not add any words to the hyphenation\n"
"list that include an optional hyphen less than\n"
"this number of characters at the beginning\n"
"or end of the word."
msgstr "No ken putim wanpela wod long hyphenation\n"
"lista sapos wod i gat optional hyphen na\n"
"em i sotpela long namba bilong leta\n"
"long stat o pinis bilong wod."

#: temp.glade:589
msgid "Minimum affix:"
msgstr "Minimum affix:"

#: temp.glade:618 temp.glade:634
msgid "The minimum word length (including \n"
"optional hyphens) that will be added\n"
"to the hyphenation list."
msgstr "Minimum longpela bilong wanpela wod (wantaim\n"
"ol optional hyphen) bai i go long\n"
"hyphenation lis."

#: temp.glade:623
msgid "Minimum length:"
msgstr "Minimum longpela:"

#: temp.glade:650 temp.glade:663
msgid "Minimum word length for a word\n"
"to block hyphenation."
msgstr "Minimum longpela bilong wanpela wod\n"
"bilong pasim hyphenation."

#: temp.glade:652
msgid "Min non-hyphen:"
msgstr "Min non-hyphen:"

#: lib/ptxprint/gtkview.py:3075
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Advanced"

#: temp.glade:701
msgid "When Creating Hyphenation List"
msgstr "Taim Kamapim Hyphenation Lis"

#: temp.glade:1244
msgid "PTXprint: Add Tatweel (kashida) Rules"
msgstr "PTXprint: Putim ol Tatweel (kashida) Rule"

#: temp.glade:1327 temp.glade:1346
msgid "Enter the verse reference\n"
"where the word is located.\n"
"\n"
"(Note that the reference is\n"
"automatically updated from\n"
"the current Paratext reference.)"
msgstr "Putim ves referens\n"
"long ples wod i stap.\n"
"\n"
"(Harim: referens i senis yet\n"
"long referens bilong Paratext\n"
"i stap nau.)"

#: temp.glade:1335
msgid "JHN 3:16"
msgstr "JHN 3:16"

#: temp.glade:1354 temp.glade:5059
msgid "Reference:"
msgstr "Referens:"

#: temp.glade:1369 temp.glade:1391
msgid "Enter the word to be lengthened\n"
"and place the cursor at the location\n"
"and use shortcut Ctrl-` (Ctrl-grave) \n"
"to insert Tatweels. Repeat at other \n"
"words and/or locations.\n"
"\n"
"(Note that this box is automatically\n"
"updated from the clipboard if the\n"
"word/phrase is 60 characters or less)."
msgstr "Putim wod bai yu mekim i longpela,\n"
"na putim kasa long ples em,\n"
"na usim shortcut Ctrl-` (Ctrl-grave)\n"
"bilong putim Tatweel. Mekim gen long\n"
"narapela wod na/o ples.\n"
"\n"
"(Harim: dispela boks i senis yet\n"
"long klipbod sapos wod/frais\n"
"i 60 leta o i liklik.)"

#: temp.glade:1380
msgid "text from clipboard"
msgstr "tekst long klipbod"

#: temp.glade:1402
msgid "Word / Phrase:"
msgstr "Wod / Frais:"

#: temp.glade:1414
msgid "How many Tatweels should\n"
"be inserted at the current\n"
"cursor location?\n"
msgstr "Hamas Tatweel bai yu putim\n"
"long ples kasa i stap nau?\n"

#: temp.glade:1420
msgid "Tatweels to insert:"
msgstr "Tatweel bilong putim:"

#: temp.glade:1432
msgid "How many Tatweels should\n"
"be inserted at the current\n"
"cursor location?"
msgstr "Hamas Tatweel i mas go insait\n"
"long ples we kersa i stap\n"
"nau?"

