"Left, Right, Center, hamas lain (i go antap o i go daun)."

#: temp.glade:11570
msgid "The frame size determines how large the sidebar\n"
"will appear on the page.\n"
"\n"
"Span Width only allows a Top or Bottom vertical placement.\n"
"Column Width allows several other more precise placement \n"
"options: Before Verse, After Paragraph, or Cutout; and these\n"
"can have Left/Inner or Right/Outer Horizontal positioning set. \n"
" \n"
"When using single column layout, there is no\n"
"difference between Column Width and Span Width."
msgstr "Sais bilong frem i makim hamas bikpela sidebar bai i kamap long pes.\n"
"\n"
"Span Width i larim Top o Bottom tasol long ples i go antap o i go daun.\n"
"Column Width i larim ol narapela wei long putim sidebar i stret moa: Before Verse, After Paragraph, o Cutout; na ol dispela i ken igat Left/Inner o Right/Outer Horizontal pozisen. \n"
" \n"
"Sapos yu yusim wanpela kolum tasol, Column Width na Span Width i no gat narapela samting."

