"Key:\n"
"\n"
"Left=shrink       Right=expand\n"
"\n"
"blu=ol lain shrink/expand\n"
"red=tekst shrink/expand\n"
"\n"
"Red na blu i miksim i makim\n"
"olgeta lain na tekst i shrink\n"
