#: temp.glade:26588 temp.glade:26646 temp.glade:26704
msgid "The header line on each page can contain the page number, \n"
"and/or reference(s) in various forms. Select a preset option,\n"
"or type in a keyword with additional adornments as needed. \n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"\\bookalt\\ \\rangeref   uses the book name from the \\h1 alt book header\n"
"[\\pagenumber]    places square brackets around the page number\n"
"DRAFT\\ \\isodate\\ \\hrsmins    gives \"DRAFT YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM\"\n"
"-empty-     places nothing in that location\n"
"\n"
"With Mirror Pages on, First Reference and Last\n"
"Reference are swapped on left-hand (even) pages.\n"
"\n"
"Note that a space and the following certain special \n"
"characters require a slash '\\' to be typed before them:\n"
"    # % & ^ ~ and \\ itself.\n"
"For example, to get this output: \n"
"     This is page #1\n"
"you would need to enter:\n"
"     This\\ is\\ page\\ \\#\\pagenumber"
msgstr "Header lain long olgeta pes i ken holim namba bilong pes, na/o refrens long ol narapela wei. Makim wanpela preset opsen, o taipim wanpela keyword wantaim ol narapela samting sapos yu laik.\n"
"\n"
"Bilong eksampel:\n"
"\\bookalt\\ \\rangeref   i yusim nem bilong buk long \\h1 alt book header\n"
"[\\pagenumber]    i putim square brekets raun long namba bilong pes\n"
"DRAFT\\ \\isodate\\ \\hrsmins    i givim \"DRAFT YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM\"\n"
"-empty-     i no putim wanpela samting long dispela hap\n"
"\n"
"Sapos Mirror Pages i op, First Reference na Last Reference i senis ples long ol pes long han kais (even).\n"
"\n"
"Save: spes na sampela spesel kerekta i kam bihain long en i nid long wanpela slash '\\' i go pastaim long ol:\n"
"    # % & ^ ~ na \\ yet.\n"
"Bilong eksampel, bilong kisim dispela:\n"
"     This is page #1\n"
"yu mas taipim:\n"
"     This\\ is\\ page\\ \\#\\pagenumber"

