"\n"
"Savetim olsem yu ken klikim nem bilong wanpela seting i bold \n"
"bilong RESET em i go bek long value bilong stylesheet."

#: temp.glade:34691
msgid "Why are some parameters bold?"
msgstr "Bilong wanem sampela parameter i bold?"

#: temp.glade:34706
msgid "   |   "
msgstr ""

#: temp.glade:34718
msgid "Stylesheets are applied in this order with later settings overriding earlier settings:\n"
"\n"
"usfm_sb.sty is the underlying Paratext stylesheet (uneditable).\n"
"\n"
"ptx2pdf.sty contains PTXprint application modifications to make things work better (uneditable).\n"
"\n"
"Optional: custom.sty contains style modifications that are project-wide and also affect display of text within Paratext itself (can be edited from the Advanced tab). Typically used to add project-specific markers.\n"
"\n"
"ptxprint.sty contains the config's settings as edited by this Styles editor.\n"
"\n"
"Optional: ptxprint-mods.sty can be edited from the Advanced tab. Because it comes last, it takes priority.\n"
msgstr "Ol Stylesheet i wok long dispela order, na ol seting i kam bihain i winim ol seting i kam paslain:\n"
"\n"
"usfm_sb.sty em i stylesheet bilong Paratext (yu no inap senisim).\n"
"\n"
"ptx2pdf.sty i gat ol senis bilong PTXprint bilong mekim ol samting i wok gutpela (yu no inap senisim).\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu laik: custom.sty i gat ol senis bilong style i go long olgeta projek na i tilim tu pasin bilong soim tekst insait long Paratext yet (yu ken senisim long Advanced tab). Planti taim ol i yusim bilong putim ol marker bilong projek tasol.\n"
"\n"
"ptxprint.sty i gat ol seting bilong config, em Styles editor i senisim.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu laik: ptxprint-mods.sty yu ken senisim long Advanced tab. Long wanem em i stap las, em i kisim namba wan ples.\n"

#: temp.glade:34731
msgid "How are Stylesheets applied?"
msgstr "Ol Stylesheet i wok olsem wanem?"

#: temp.glade:34754
msgid "Include Contents of Marker"
msgstr "Putim Samting Insait long Marker"

#: temp.glade:34759
msgid "Uncheck this option to set the marker to\n"
"\"non-publishable\" so the contents of this \n"
"marker will not be included in the output."
msgstr "Rausim mak long dispela opsen bilong makim marker olsem\n"
"\"non-publishable\" na samting insait long dispela \n"
"marker i no inap kamap long output."

#: temp.glade:34792
msgid "Edit style information of\n"
"markers without having to\n"
"edit the USFM stylesheet files."
msgstr "Senisim style infomesen bilong\n"
"ol marker, na yu no nid long\n"
"senisim ol USFM stylesheet fail."

#: temp.glade:34882
msgid "Apply Customized Settings (ptxprint-mods.tex)"
msgstr "Yusim Ol Seting Yu Mekim (ptxprint-mods.tex)"

#: temp.glade:34887
msgid "This is the normal file for advanced users to \n"
"configure TeX. This .tex file executes AFTER \n"
"all the PTXprint settings. "
msgstr "Dispela em i fail bilong ol man i save gut long \n"
"konfigarim TeX. Dispela .tex fail i wok BIHAIN \n"
"long olgeta seting bilong PTXprint. "

#: temp.glade:34907
msgid "Process Text With \n"
"Custom Script at:"
msgstr "Wokim Tekst Wantaim \n"
"Custom Script long:"

#: temp.glade:34913
msgid "Processes the .usfm file through a program of your choosing. \n"
"The program is run as `prog infile outfile` where infile is the \n"
"source .usfm file and outfile the output .usfm that will then be typeset."
msgstr "I wokim .usfm fail long wanpela program yu makim. \n"
"Program i wok olsem `prog infile outfile` we infile em i \n"
".usfm fail bilong stat na outfile em i .usfm bilong output we bai ol i typeset."

#: temp.glade:34934
msgid "start"
msgstr "stat"

#: temp.glade:34938
msgid "Execute processing script BEFORE running \n"
"any printdraftchanges, canonicalisation \n"
"(i.e. Auto-Correct USFM) or local changes\n"
"which are all specified below."
msgstr "Mekim processing script PASLAIN long wokim \n"
"ol printdraftchanges, canonicalisation \n"
"(olsem Auto-Correct USFM) o ol senis bilong hia\n"
"ol i stap daunbilo."

#: temp.glade:34955
msgid "end"
msgstr "pinis"

#: temp.glade:34959
msgid "Execute processing script AFTER running \n"
"any printdraftchanges, canonicalisation \n"
"(i.e. Auto-Correct USFM) or local changes\n"
"which are all specified below."
msgstr "Mekim processing script BIHAIN long wokim \n"
"ol printdraftchanges, canonicalisation \n"
"(olsem Auto-Correct USFM) o ol senis bilong hia\n"
"ol i stap daunbilo."

#: temp.glade:35008
msgid "Apply Modifications to USFM Text (changes.txt)"
msgstr "Mekim Senis long USFM Tekst (changes.txt)"

#: temp.glade:35013
msgid "If there are changes that you wish to\n"
"apply to the USFM file(s) prior to\n"
"producing the printout, then these\n"
"can be specified in these files:\n"
"\n"
"changes.txt - is used for changes that\n"
"only apply to the current configuration;\n"
"\n"
"PrintDraftChanges.txt - specifies changes\n"
"which apply to all configurations, and gets\n"
"'included' at the top of changes.txt"
msgstr "Sapos yu laik mekim ol senis long\n"
"USFM fail paslain long\n"
"printim, orait yu ken makim ol\n"
"long ol dispela fail:\n"
"\n"
"changes.txt - bilong ol senis i wok\n"
"long configuration i stap nau tasol;\n"
"\n"
"PrintDraftChanges.txt - i makim ol senis\n"
"i wok long olgeta configuration, na\n"
"ol i putim long antap bilong changes.txt"

#: temp.glade:35042
msgid "Switch to the View+Edit tab to\n"
"show the Changes.txt file in\n"
"one tab, and PrintDraftChanges.txt\n"
"in the next tab to the right.\n"
"\n"
"Shortcut: Shift-Ctrl-C"
msgstr "Go long View+Edit tab bilong\n"
"soim Changes.txt fail long\n"
"wanpela tab, na PrintDraftChanges.txt\n"
"long tab i stap long han sut.\n"
"\n"
"Shortcut: Shift-Ctrl-C"

#: temp.glade:35067
msgid "Switch to the View+Edit tab to\n"
"show the ptxprint-mods.tex file.\n"
"\n"
"Shortcut: Shift-Ctrl-T"
msgstr "Go long View+Edit tab bilong\n"
"soim ptxprint-mods.tex fail.\n"
"\n"
"Shortcut: Shift-Ctrl-T"

#: temp.glade:35090
msgid "Switch to the View+Edit tab to\n"
"show the ptxprint-mods.sty file.\n"
"\n"
"Shortcut: Shift-Ctrl-S"
msgstr "Go long View+Edit tab bilong\n"
"soim ptxprint-mods.sty fail.\n"
"\n"
"Shortcut: Shift-Ctrl-S"

#: temp.glade:35108
msgid "Apply Stylesheet Overrides (ptxprint-mods.sty)"
msgstr "Yusim Stylesheet Overrides (ptxprint-mods.sty)"

#: temp.glade:35113
msgid "It is recommended to leave \n"
"this option unchecked (off)\n"
"unless you have intentionally\n"
"customized styles using the\n"
"ptxprint-mods.sty stylesheet and \n"
"wish for these to be used by PTXprint."
msgstr "Gutpela yu no makim dispela opsen\n"
"(i stap off) sapos yu no bin\n"
"senisim ol style long ptxprint-mods.sty\n"
"stylesheet long laik bilong yu na yu laik\n"
"PTXprint i yusim ol."

#: temp.glade:35132
msgid "Apply Customized Styles (custom.sty)"
msgstr "Usim Ol Stail Mipela Yet Senisim (custom.sty)"

#: temp.glade:35137
msgid "It is recommended to leave \n"
"this option unchecked (off)\n"
"unless you have intentionally\n"
"customized styles using the\n"
"custom.sty stylesheet and wish \n"
"for these to be used by PTXprint."
msgstr "Gutpela long larim dispela opsen i stap nating (i no makim)\n"
"sapos yu no bin senisim ol stail long wei bilong custom.sty stylesheet na yu no laik PTXprint i usim ol."

#: temp.glade:35161
msgid "Switch to the View+Edit tab to\n"
"show the custom.sty file.\n"
"\n"
"Shortcut: Shift-Ctrl-M"
msgstr "Go long tab View+Edit long soim fail custom.sty.\n"
"\n"
"Shortkat: Shift-Ctrl-M"

#: temp.glade:35184
msgid "Edit the processing script"
msgstr "Edit long processing script"

#: temp.glade:35203
msgid "Switch to the View+Edit tab to\n"
"show the ptxprint-premods.tex file.\n"
"\n"
"Shortcut: Shift-Ctrl-P"
msgstr "Go long tab View+Edit long soim fail ptxprint-premods.tex.\n"
"\n"
"Shortkat: Shift-Ctrl-P"

#: temp.glade:35219
msgid "Apply Initial Settings (ptxprint-premods.tex)"
msgstr "Usim Ol Fas Seting (ptxprint-premods.tex)"

#: temp.glade:35224
msgid "This .tex file is executed BEFORE any stylesheets of \n"
"other settings are applied. This file is rarely used."
msgstr "Dispela .tex fail i wok BIPO long ol stylesheet o ol narapela seting i wok. Ol i no save usim dispela fail planti taim."

#: temp.glade:35245
msgid "Text Processing & Stylesheets"
msgstr "Prosesim Tekst na Ol Stylesheet"

#: temp.glade:35303
msgid "Sensitive Project"
msgstr "Sensitiv Projek"

#: temp.glade:35308
msgid "In sensitive locations the illustration copyright\n"
"statement(s) can just contain the appropriate\n"
"acronyms (e.g. BFBS or DCC) for some artists.\n"
"\n"
"In addition, the PDF's metadata will not contain\n"
"sensitive project-specific data."
msgstr "Long ol hap we i sensitiv, ol kopirait stetmen bilong ol piksa i ken garim ol sotpela nem tasol (olsem BFBS o DCC) bilong sampela man bilong droim piksa.\n"
"\n"
"Taim yet, metadata bilong PDF i no gat ol data bilong projek i sensitiv."

#: temp.glade:35326
msgid "Auto-Correct USFM"
msgstr "Stretim USFM Yet"

#: temp.glade:35331
msgid "PTXprint can analyze the USFM files and\n"
"automatically correct some common \n"
"errors in syntax. It will also notify you of \n"
"errors which are likely to cause the print \n"
"process to fail - giving you helpful feedback\n"
"about how to fix the issue before re-trying \n"
"to print."
msgstr "PTXprint i ken skelim ol USFM fail na stretim yet sampela asua i save kamap long sintaks. Em i ken tokim yu tu long ol asua i save mekim printim i pundaun, na givim yu helpim long wanem rot bilong stretim pastaim long yu traim printim gen."

#: temp.glade:35356
msgid "Interlinear  &  Code:"
msgstr "Interlinear na Kod:"

#: temp.glade:35361
msgid "Convert Paratext's interlinear data\n"
"text to ruby (glossing) so that an\n"
"interlinear text can be printed.\n"
"\n"
"Note that  you may need to adjust \n"
"the following marker styles:\n"
"  \\rb    for the base text \n"
"  \\gloss|rb    for the gloss text\n"
"\n"
"Note that if this Interlinear option is enabled, then\n"
"the Spacing Adjustments Between Letters (on the\n"
"Fonts+Scripts page) will be disabled as these two\n"
"settings are mutually exclusive."
msgstr "Senisim interlinear data tekst bilong Paratext i go long ruby (glos) bai yu ken printim interlinear tekst.\n"
"\n"
"Save olsem yu ken needim senisim ol marker stail i kamap bihain:\n"
"  \\rb    bilong baset tekst \n"
"  \\gloss|rb    bilong glos tekst\n"
"\n"
"Save olsem sapos Interlinear opsen i op, orait Spacing Adjustments Between Letters (long Fonts+Scripts peij) bai i no wok, bikos dispela tupela seting i no inap wok wantaim."

#: temp.glade:35388
msgid "Interlinear language code to use.\n"
"To find which code to use, look \n"
"in the project folder for a folder \n"
"named \"Interlinear_xy\" where xy\n"
"is the language code. \n"
"For example if the interlinear has\n"
"been glossed into English, then \n"
"the code would be \"en\"."
msgstr "Kod bilong tok ples bilong interlinear yu laik usim.\n"
"Long painim kod, lukim long project folder wanpela folder\n"
"nem bilong en \"Interlinear_xy\" we xy em kod bilong tok ples.\n"
"Olsem sapos interlinear i gat glos long Inglis,\n"
"kod bai \"en\"."

#: temp.glade:35411
msgid "Ruby Text Above"
msgstr "Ruby Tekst i Stap Antap"

#: temp.glade:35416
msgid "Treat ruby text as ruby rather than \n"
"interlinear text by placing it above \n"
"the base text rather than below.\n"
"\n"
"Note that  you may need to adjust \n"
"the following marker styles:\n"
"  \\rb    for the base text \n"
"  \\gloss|rb    for the gloss text\n"
"Use the shortcut links on the right\n"
"to locate those styles in the editor."
msgstr "Usim ruby tekst olsem ruby, i no olsem interlinear tekst, long putim antap long baset tekst, i no daunbilo.\n"
"\n"
"Save olsem yu ken needim senisim ol marker stail i kamap bihain:\n"
"  \\rb    bilong baset tekst \n"
"  \\gloss|rb    bilong glos tekst\n"
"Usim ol shortkat link long sait i stap long han kais long painim dispela ol stail long editor."

#: temp.glade:35445
msgid "Click to jump to the \\rb marker in\n"
"the style editor to change the\n"
"formatting of the ruby text."
msgstr "Klikim long go long \\rb marker long stail editor long senisim fomat bilong ruby tekst."

#: temp.glade:35466
msgid "Click to jump to the \\gloss|rb \n"
"marker in the style editor to \n"
"change the formatting of the \n"
"glosses for interlinear/ruby text."
msgstr "Klikim long go long \\gloss|rb marker long stail editor long senisim fomat bilong ol glos bilong interlinear/ruby tekst."

#: temp.glade:35490
msgid "Only Use English Links"
msgstr "Usim Ol Inglis Link Tasol"

#: temp.glade:35495
msgid "When using a non-English interface (such as French,\n"
"Spanish, Hindi, etc.) most links to external websites get\n"
"sent via the Google Translate site so that you can read\n"
"the information in the same language as the selected\n"
"interface.\n"
"\n"
"Enable this option if Google is blocked in your country,\n"
"or you simply prefer to read the original page in English."
msgstr "Taim yu usim interface i no Inglis (olsem Frens, Spenis, Hindi, na ol narapela) planti link i go long ol website ausait i save go long Google Translate sait, bai yu ken ritim infomesen long tok ples bilong interface yu makim.\n"
"\n"
"Opim dispela opsen sapos gavman bilong kantri bilong yu i pasim Google, o yu laik ritim orijinal peij long Inglis."

#: temp.glade:35518
msgid "Disable ALL Internet Use"
msgstr "Pasim OLGETA Intanet Usim"

#: temp.glade:35523
msgid "PTXprint checks for program updates and also\n"
"contains links to external sites (mainly from \n"
"the Styles tab and the Help tab). If this is an\n"
"issue, then check this option to prevent\n"
"PTXprint from accessing the internet."
msgstr "PTXprint i save skelim sapos nupela vesen i stap, na i gat ol link i go long ol sait ausait (moa long Styles tab na Help tab). Sapos dispela i mekim hevi, makim dispela opsen long pasim PTXprint long go long intanet."

#: temp.glade:35551 temp.glade:35570
msgid "Some advanced features load extra code\n"
"that is not normally needed. List them\n"
"here if you need to use them. For example,\n"
"if you are generating a QR code, then you\n"
"need to add qr to the list of plugins. For a\n"
"polyglot, you can add polyglot-simplepages"
msgstr "Sampela advanced fisa i save lodim extra kod we i no save nidim olgeta taim. Putim nem bilong ol long hia sapos yu nidim ol. Olsem, sapos yu mekim wanpela QR kod, orait yu mas putim qr long lista bilong ol plugin. Bilong polyglot, yu ken putim polyglot-simplepages"

#: temp.glade:35557
msgid "Plugins:"
msgstr "Ol Plugin:"

#: temp.glade:35586
msgid "Use Interlinear Punctuation"
msgstr "Yusim Punctuation bilong Interlinear"

#: temp.glade:35591
msgid "Include specifically modified\n"
"interlinearized punctuation."
msgstr "Putim ol punctuation bilong\n"
"interlinear we ol i senisim."

#: temp.glade:35614 temp.glade:35615
msgid "Auto-tag Hebrew and Greek words"
msgstr "Tagim Hibru na Grik tok otomatik"

#: temp.glade:35619
msgid "Auto-tag Hebrew words \\wh ... \\wh*\n"
"and Greek words with  \\wg ... \\wg*\n"
"\n"
"PTXprint can automatically tag all\n"
"source language words (Hebrew and\n"
"Greek) with the appropriate markup\n"
"to ensure they display with the right\n"
"font and direction for that script."
msgstr "Tagim ol Hibru tok \\wh ... \\wh*\n"
"na ol Grik tok long  \\wg ... \\wg*\n"
"\n"
"PTXprint inap tagim olgeta tok bilong\n"
"sos lanwis (Hibru na Grik) otomatik\n"
"wantaim stret markup, bai ol i soim\n"
"stret font na direksen bilong dispela skript."

#: temp.glade:35641
msgid "Lock XeTeX Layout Level"
msgstr "Lokim XeTeX Layout Level"

#: temp.glade:35646
msgid "This feature enables final typesetting to proceed \n"
"with minimal risk of change to the final layout by\n"
"locking the TeX macros to use the current layout\n"
"logic, which will prevent newer functionality\n"
"from taking effect in the future. This sets the\n"
"\"Maximum Layout Version\" value in the \n"
"TeXpert Hacks section."
msgstr "Dispela i larim las typesetting i go het\n"
"wantaim liklik hevi bilong senis long las layout.\n"
"I lokim ol TeX macro long yusim layout logic\n"
"bilong nau, na bai nupela fangksen i no inap\n"
"kam long bihain. Dispela i makim \"Maximum Layout Version\"\n"
"valu long TeXpert Hacks sekson."

#: temp.glade:35665 temp.glade:35666
msgid "Lock UI Layout Settings"
msgstr "Lokim UI Layout Seting"

#: temp.glade:35670
msgid "This feature enables final typesetting to proceed \n"
"with minimal risk of change to the final layout by\n"
"disabling various controls (on the layout, fonts and\n"
"styles tabs) so that settings can't be accidentally \n"
"changed while doing final page layout."
msgstr "Dispela i larim las typesetting i go het\n"
"wantaim liklik hevi bilong senis long las layout.\n"
"I pasim ol kontrol (long ol tab bilong layout, font na\n"
"style) olsem ol seting i no inap senis long asua\n"
"taim yu wokim las page layout."

#: temp.glade:35694
msgid "General"
msgstr "Jenerol"

#: temp.glade:35750
msgid "Test recording in progress"
msgstr "Test recording i wok nau"

#: temp.glade:35755
msgid "Record PTXPrint options clicked\n"
"for use in creating an automated test.\n"
"\n"
"Will stop recording when Save is pressed\n"
"or the checkbox is unticked and a dialog\n"
"will allow saving the test in zip format."
msgstr "Rekodim ol PTXprint opsen yu klikim\n"
"long wokim wanpela otomatik test.\n"
"\n"
"Bai i stop long rekodim taim yu pushim Seivim\n"
"o yu rausim tik long boks, na wanpela dialog\n"
"bai larim yu seivim test long zip format."

#: temp.glade:35778
msgid "Capture tests?"
msgstr "Kisim ol test?"

#: temp.glade:35808
msgid "Main"
msgstr "Main"

#: temp.glade:35951
msgid "To balance columns of text on a page it is possible\n"
"to specify paragraphs adjustments (shrink or expand):\n"
"\n"
"A Paragraph Adjust List needs to be in this format:\n"
"MRK 2.7 +1    (i.e. expand the para at Mark 2.7 by one line) \n"
"MRK 3.20 -1   (i.e. shrink the para at Mark 3:20 by one line)\n"
"%MARK 4.14 +1   (ignore this line - treat it as a comment)   \n"
"MRK 5.8 +2    (i.e. expand the para at Mark 5.8 by two lines)\n"
"MRK 6.23 +1[2]  (expand the paragraph AFTER the paragraph \n"
"                              which contains MRK 6.23 e.g. a heading.)\n"
"etc.\n"
"Note that adjusting paragraphs needs to be done right at the\n"
"end when all other settings have been finalized. Otherwise you\n"
"are likely to have to re-do it all again."
msgstr "Bilong ekwalaisim ol kolom bilong tok long wanpela page,\n"
"yu inap makim ol senis bilong paragraf (liklikim o bikim):\n"
"\n"
"Wanpela Paragraph Adjust List i mas stap long dispela format:\n"
"MRK 2.7 +1    (i min, bikim paragraf long Mak 2.7 long wanpela lain) \n"
"MRK 3.20 -1   (i min, liklikim paragraf long Mak 3:20 long wanpela lain)\n"
"%MARK 4.14 +1   (lusim dispela lain - tingim olsem komen)   \n"
"MRK 5.8 +2    (i min, bikim paragraf long Mak 5.8 long tupela lain)\n"
"MRK 6.23 +1[2]  (bikim paragraf BIHAIN long paragraf \n"
"                              we i gat MRK 6.23 olsem wanpela heding.)\n"
"na ol narapela.\n"
"Tingim olsem senisim ol paragraf i mas kamap long as bilong wok\n"
"taim yu pinisim ol narapela seting. Sapos nogat, yu\n"
"bai mas mekim gen olgeta."

#: temp.glade:36020
msgid "Filter: show only sections with non-default settings.\n"
"Sections where all values are default will be hidden.\n"
"Sections with changed values will be expanded.\n"
"Disable to restore all sections in collapsed state."
msgstr "Filta: soim ol sekson tasol we ol seting i narapela long default.\n"
"Ol sekson we olgeta valu i default bai i hait.\n"
"Ol sekson we ol valu i senis bai i opim.\n"
"Rausim dispela bai olgeta sekson i pas gen."

#: temp.glade:36054
msgid "Define stylesheets, tex macros,\n"
"front and back matter PDFs, \n"
"watermarks and various other\n"
"advanced settings including\n"
"interlinear (& ruby text) output."
msgstr "Makim ol stylesheet, tex macro,\n"
"PDF bilong front matter na back matter,\n"
"watermark na ol narapela\n"
"advanced seting, wantaim\n"
"interlinear (na ruby text) output."

#: temp.glade:36099
msgid "Discard any changes that have \n"
"been made and restore the contents\n"
"of this file as it was when last saved.\n"
"\n"
"Shortcut: F5"
msgstr "Rausim olgeta senis yu mekim pinis\n"
"na bringim bek ol samting bilong\n"
"dispela fail olsem long taim yu seivim las.\n"
"\n"
"Shortcut: F5"

#: temp.glade:36124
msgid "Book in\n"
"Focus:"
msgstr "Buk\n"
"long Fokus:"

#: temp.glade:36137
msgid "Choose any book (including\n"
"those which are not currently\n"
"in the list to be printed.)"
msgstr "Makim wanpela buk (wantaim ol buk\n"
"i no stap nau long lista bilong\n"
"printim.)"

#: temp.glade:36165
msgid "Generate"
msgstr "Kamapim"

#: temp.glade:36170
msgid "This button will (re-)generate content for \n"
"Front Matter, AdjList(s) and Final SFM.\n"
"\n"
"If you only want to (re-)generate an Adj List for \n"
"a single book, then just select that book on the \n"
"Basic tab. Otherwise it will (re-)generate a Pic/Adj\n"
"list for each of the books listed for printing.\n"
"\n"
"Shortcut: Ctrl-G"
msgstr "Dispela boton bai kamapim (gen) ol samting bilong\n"
"Front Matter, AdjList(s) na Final SFM.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu laik kamapim (gen) Adj List bilong\n"
"wanpela buk tasol, makim dispela buk long\n"
"Basic tab. Sapos nogat, bai i kamapim wanpela Pic/Adj\n"
"list bilong olgeta buk i stap long lista bilong printim.\n"
"\n"
"Shortcut: Ctrl-G"

#: temp.glade:36191
msgid "View/Edit..."
msgstr "Lukim/Edit..."

#: temp.glade:36197
msgid "You may view (and in some cases edit) \n"
"the file in your system's text Editor.\n"
"\n"
"Warning: If you edit settings in an external\n"
"editor, be careful to save them (externally)\n"
"and then click the refresh button (within \n"
"PTXprint) before you hit Print. Otherwise \n"
"you could lose changes that were made.\n"
"\n"
"If nothing happens when you click here, it is\n"
"probably because you have not associated the\n"
"file type (.sfm, .piclist, .adjlist, .tex, .log, .sty etc.)\n"
"with a text editor (such as Notepad or NP++).\n"
"\n"
"Note that any changes to the Final SFM text get\n"
"overwritten each time you hit Print. So any changes\n"
"to the text or markers need to be made in Paratext.\n"
"\n"
"Shortcut: Ctrl-E"
msgstr "Yu ken lukim (na sampela taim edit) \n"
"dispela fail long text Editor bilong kompyuta bilong yu.\n"
"\n"
"Trangu: Sapos yu edit ol seting long narapela\n"
"editor, lukaut long seivim ol (long narapela)\n"
"na klikim refresh boton (insait long \n"
"PTXprint) pastaim long yu pushim Print. Sapos nogat \n"
"ol senis inap lus.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos nating i nogat samting i kamap taim yu klikim hia, \n"
"samting i kirap long wanem yu no bin joinim\n"
"taip bilong fail (.sfm, .piclist, .adjlist, .tex, .log, .sty na ol narapela)\n"
"wantaim wanpela text editor (olsem Notepad o NP++).\n"
"\n"
"Tingim olsem ol senis long Final SFM text bai i\n"
"save lus long olgeta taim yu pushim Print. So ol senis\n"
"long text o ol marka i mas kamap long Paratext.\n"
"\n"
"Shortcut: Ctrl-E"

#: temp.glade:36229
msgid "Edit Variables..."
msgstr "Edit Variables..."

#: temp.glade:36235
msgid "If you have used \\zvar_variable names\n"
"in the front matter template, these may\n"
"be edited on the \"Pub. Info\" tab. Click\n"
"this button to show that tab."
msgstr "Sapos yu bin yusim ol \\zvar_variable nem\n"
"long front matter template, yu ken edit ol\n"
"long \"Pub. Info\" tab. Klikim\n"
"dispela boton long soim dispela tab."

#: temp.glade:36254
msgid "Use the following codes to include special text in front matter:\n"
"\n"
"  \\nopagenums - turn OFF page numbers\n"
"  \\dopagenums - turn ON page number\n"
"  \\resetpagenums # - where # is the page number\n"
"(setting # to -1 gives roman numerals i,ii,iii,iv,v,...)\n"
"\n"
"  \\pc \\zcopyright - copyright statement from the Basic tab\n"
"  \\pc \\zlicense - license statement from the Basic tab\n"
"  \\pc \\zimagecopyrights - generated list of images with copyright attribution\n"
"  \\pc \\zimagecopyrightsfr - as above, but localized (fr = French)\n"
"\n"
"  \\zbl|3\\* - inserts 3 blank lines\n"
"  \\zgap|1.5in\\*\n"
"\n"
"To include one or more table of contents:\n"
"  \\ztoc|<keyword>\\*\n"
"Where <keyword> can be replaced with:\n"
"  main – primary, all-inclusive table of contents\n"
"  pre – any book prior to scripture (FRT, INT)\n"
"  ot – only Old Testament books are listed\n"
"  heb - OT books sorted according to the Hebrew TaNaKh\n"
"  dc – only Deutero Canonical books are listed\n"
"  nt – only New Testament books are listed\n"
"  post – books that occur after REV (GLO, BAK, TDX, NDX, XXA-G)\n"
"  sorta – alphabetical (main) list sorted by \\toc1\n"
"  sortb – alphabetical (main) list sorted by \\toc2\n"
"  sortc – alphabetical (main) list sorted by \\toc3\n"
"\n"
"In addition to the above-mentioned codes, you may specify\n"
"your own config-specific \\zvar|variables\\* as place-holders.\n"
"Click on 'Edit Variables...' to assign values to these variables\n"
"on the Peripherals tab. For example:\n"
"  \\mt1 \\zvar|maintitle\\*\n"
"  \\mt2 \\zvar|subtitle\\*"
msgstr "Usim ol kod i stap aninit long putim spesol tekst long front matter:\n"
"\n"
"  \\nopagenums - pasim (OFF) namba bilong pes\n"
"  \\dopagenums - opim (ON) namba bilong pes\n"
"  \\resetpagenums # - # em i namba bilong pes\n"
"(sapos yu putim # long -1, bai i kamap roman namba i,ii,iii,iv,v,...)\n"
"\n"
"  \\pc \\zcopyright - copyright statement bilong Basic tab\n"
"  \\pc \\zlicense - license statement bilong Basic tab\n"
"  \\pc \\zimagecopyrights - lista bilong ol piksa wantaim copyright attribution, na kompiuta i kamapim\n"
"  \\pc \\zimagecopyrightsfr - olsem antap, tasol long tok ples (fr = Frens)\n"
"\n"
"  \\zbl|3\\* - putim 3 blank lain\n"
"  \\zgap|1.5in\\*\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu laik putim wanpela o moa table of contents:\n"
"  \\ztoc|<keyword>\\*\n"
"Yu ken senisim <keyword> long wanpela bilong dispela:\n"
"  main – namba wan table of contents, i garim olgeta\n"
"  pre – ol buk i stap pastaim long Skripsa (FRT, INT)\n"
"  ot – ol buk bilong Olpela Testamen tasol\n"
"  heb - ol buk bilong OT i stap long order bilong Hebrew TaNaKh\n"
"  dc – ol Deutero Canonical buk tasol\n"
"  nt – ol buk bilong Nupela Testamen tasol\n"
"  post – ol buk i kam bihain long REV (GLO, BAK, TDX, NDX, XXA-G)\n"
"  sorta – alphabet lista (main) i stap long order bilong \\toc1\n"
"  sortb – alphabet lista (main) i stap long order bilong \\toc2\n"
"  sortc – alphabet lista (main) i stap long order bilong \\toc3\n"
"\n"
"Bilong dispela ol kod antap, yu ken makim tu\n"
"ol \\zvar|variables\\* bilong yu yet long dispela config.\n"
"Klikim 'Edit Variables...' long givim ol vael long ol variable\n"
"long Peripherals tab. Olsem:\n"
"  \\mt1 \\zvar|maintitle\\*\n"
"  \\mt2 \\zvar|subtitle\\*"

#: temp.glade:36308
msgid "Autosave"
msgstr "Autosave"

#: temp.glade:36313
msgid "Save any changes made below\n"
"without a confirmation check."
msgstr "Seivim ol senis yu mekim aninit\n"
"na i no gat askim bilong kamapim."

#: temp.glade:36330
msgid "Use this slider to adjust\n"
"the size of the text on the\n"
"View+Edit tab as well as\n"
"in other locations that use \n"
"a specialized font or script.\n"
"\n"
"Keyboard Shortcuts:\n"
"  Ctrl-Minus - shrink text size\n"
"  Ctrl-Plus - grow text size"
msgstr "Usim dispela slider long senisim\n"
"bikpela bilong tekst long\n"
"View+Edit tab na long ol narapela\n"
"ples i usim spesol font o script.\n"
"\n"
"Keyboard Shortcuts:\n"
"  Ctrl-Minus - liklikim tekst\n"
"  Ctrl-Plus - bikim tekst"

#: temp.glade:36403
msgid "Front Matter"
msgstr "Front Matter"

#: temp.glade:36428
msgid "To balance columns of text on a page it is possible\n"
"to specify paragraphs adjustments (shrink or expand):\n"
"\n"
"A Paragraph Adjust List needs to be in this format:\n"
"MRK 2.7 +1    (i.e. expand the para at Mark 2.7 by one line) \n"
"MRK 3.20 -1   (i.e. shrink the para at Mark 3:20 by one line)\n"
"%MARK 4.14 +1   (ignore this line - treat it as a comment)   \n"
"MRK 5.8 +2    (i.e. expand the para at Mark 5.8 by two lines)\n"
"MRK 6.23 +1[2]  (expand the paragraph AFTER the paragraph \n"
"                              which contains MRK 6.23 e.g. a heading.)\n"
"\n"
"Diglot AdjList also need R or L to be specified after the book code\n"
"and it is important that L comes before R for the same verse.\n"
"MATL 3.4 +1\n"
"MATR 3.4 -1\n"
"MATR 3.11 +2\n"
"\n"
"Keyboard Shortcuts:\n"
"  Ctrl-1 - makes the current line +1\n"
"  Ctrl-2 - makes the 2nd para of current line +1[2]\n"
"    ... etc ...\n"
"  Ctrl-9 - makes the 9th para of current line +1[9]\n"
"\n"
"  Ctrl-I - shrink current line -1\n"
"  Ctrl-Grave - ` same as above\n"
"\n"
"  Ctrl-0 - % Comment (or uncomment) the line [it toggles]\n"
"  Ctrl-Comma - same as above\n"
"\n"
"  Ctrl-D - Duplicate the current line\n"
"  Ctlr-L - deLete the current line\n"
"  Ctrl-Up - move the current line up one line\n"
"  Ctrl-Down - move the current line down one line\n"
"\n"
"Note that adjusting paragraphs needs to be done right at the\n"
"end when all other settings have been finalized. Otherwise you\n"
"are likely to have to re-do it all again."
msgstr "Long skelim ol kolum bilong tekst long wanpela pes,\n"
"yu ken makim ol senis bilong paragraf (liklikim o bikim):\n"
"\n"
"Paragraph Adjust List i mas i gat dispela fomat:\n"
"MRK 2.7 +1    (i min olsem, bikim paragraf long Mak 2.7 long wanpela lain) \n"
"MRK 3.20 -1   (i min olsem, liklikim paragraf long Mak 3:20 long wanpela lain)\n"
"%MARK 4.14 +1   (lusim dispela lain - em i komen tasol)   \n"
"MRK 5.8 +2    (i min olsem, bikim paragraf long Mak 5.8 long tupela lain)\n"
"MRK 6.23 +1[2]  (bikim paragraf BIHAIN long paragraf \n"
"                              i gat MRK 6.23 olsem hedin.)\n"
"\n"
"Diglot AdjList i nid long R o L bihain long kod bilong buk\n"
"na i bikpela samting olsem L i mas i stap pastaim long R bilong wankain ves.\n"
"MATL 3.4 +1\n"
"MATR 3.4 -1\n"
"MATR 3.11 +2\n"
"\n"
"Keyboard Shortcuts:\n"
"  Ctrl-1 - mekim lain i stap +1\n"
"  Ctrl-2 - mekim namba 2 paragraf bilong lain i stap +1[2]\n"
"    ... na olsem ...\n"
"  Ctrl-9 - mekim namba 9 paragraf bilong lain i stap +1[9]\n"
"\n"
"  Ctrl-I - liklikim lain i stap -1\n"
"  Ctrl-Grave - ` wankain olsem antap\n"
"\n"
"  Ctrl-0 - % Komen (o rausim komen) long lain [i senis i go i kam]\n"
"  Ctrl-Comma - wankain olsem antap\n"
"\n"
"  Ctrl-D - Kopiim lain i stap\n"
"  Ctlr-L - Rausim (deLete) lain i stap\n"
"  Ctrl-Up - muvim lain i stap i go antap long wanpela lain\n"
"  Ctrl-Down - muvim lain i stap i go daun long wanpela lain\n"
"\n"
"Lukim: sapos yu laik senisim ol paragraf, mekim long las tru\n"
"bihain long yu pinisim olgeta narapela seting. Sapos nogat,\n"
"bai yu mas mekim gen olgeta samting."

#: temp.glade:36465
msgid "Adj List"
msgstr "Adj List"

#: temp.glade:36492
msgid "Final SFM"
msgstr "Final SFM"

#: temp.glade:36518
msgid ".tex file"
msgstr ".tex file"

#: temp.glade:36544
msgid "XeTeX Log"
msgstr "XeTeX Log"

#: temp.glade:36643
msgid "Use the buttons below to insert\n"
"various code snippets as required."
msgstr "Usim ol boton aninit long putim\n"
"ol kod snippet yu nid long en."

#: temp.glade:36648
msgid "Code Snippets"
msgstr "Code Snippets"

#: temp.glade:36689
msgid "More..."
msgstr "Moa..."

#: temp.glade:36695
msgid "Online documentation on a \n"
"structured list of code snippets \n"
"which can be copied and pasted \n"
"into the appropriate settings files."
msgstr "Dokumen long intenet long wanpela lista bilong ol\n"
"code snippet. Yu ken kopiim na pestim ol\n"
"long ol fail bilong seting i stret."

#: temp.glade:36733
msgid "View and edit various control\n"
"and log files. Examine final SFM\n"
"output and tweak adjust lists."
msgstr "Lukim na edit ol kontrol\n"
"na log fail. Lukim final SFM\n"
"na stretim ol adjust list."

#: temp.glade:36737
msgid "View+Edit"
msgstr "Lukim+Edit"

#: temp.glade:36768
msgid "Create Cover Page"
msgstr "Kamapim Cover Page"

#: temp.glade:36774
msgid "Create a cover (back, spine and front) as a\n"
"separate PDF file ending in _cover.pdf.\n"
"Needs Local Front Matter. Use the\n"
"Cover Wizard... to design it."
msgstr "Kamapim wanpela kava (baksait, spine na pes\n"
"bilong ai) olsem narapela PDF fail i pinis long\n"
"_cover.pdf. I mas gat Local Front Matter. Usim\n"
"Cover Wizard... long wokim dizain bilong en."

#: temp.glade:36793
msgid "Cover Wizard..."
msgstr "Cover Wizard..."

#: temp.glade:36798
msgid "Creating a cover from nothing takes a lot of effort.\n"
"This tool enables you to create various kinds of\n"
"covers which can easily be enhanced. "
msgstr "Sapos yu kamapim wanpela cover long nating, em i hat tru.\n"
"Dispela tul i helpim yu long kamapim ol kain kain\n"
"cover, na bihain yu ken stretim gut. "

#: temp.glade:36828
msgid "Click to edit the Sidebar properties \n"
"on the Styles tab for the Back Cover."
msgstr "Klikim long senisim ol seting bilong Sidebar\n"
"long Styles tab bilong Back Cover."

#: temp.glade:36849
msgid "Click to edit the Sidebar properties \n"
"on the Styles tab for the Spine."
msgstr "Klikim long senisim ol seting bilong Sidebar\n"
"long Styles tab bilong Spine."

#: temp.glade:36870
msgid "Click to edit the Sidebar properties \n"
"on the Styles tab for the Front Cover."
msgstr "Klikim long senisim ol seting bilong Sidebar\n"
"long Styles tab bilong Front Cover."

#: temp.glade:36891
msgid "Click to edit the Sidebar properties \n"
"on the Styles tab for the whole Cover Spread\n"
"(the background behind the back, spine and front)."
msgstr "Klikim long senisim ol Sidebar properties\n"
"long Styles tab bilong olgeta Cover Spread\n"
"(baksait bilong baksait, spine na pes bilong ai)."

#: temp.glade:36933
msgid "Front Matter PDF(s)"
msgstr "Front Matter PDF(s)"

#: temp.glade:36939
msgid "One or more previously created PDF file(s) can be included \n"
"BEFORE the scripture material being typeset. If more than one\n"
"file is selected, then these will appear in alphabetical order.\n"
"\n"
"If you are creating an electronic publication and want to\n"
"add a fancy (colour) cover, then consider designing a\n"
"cover using the online Canva.com tool."
msgstr "Wanpela o moa PDF fail ol i bin wokim pinis i ken stap\n"
"BIHAIN long Skripsa tekst ol i printim. Sapos yu makim\n"
"moa long wanpela fail, ol bai i kamap long order bilong alfabet.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu wokim wanpela electronic publication na yu laik\n"
"putim wanpela naispela (kala) kava, tingim long wokim\n"
"kava long usim Canva.com tul long intanet."

#: temp.glade:37010
msgid "Table of Contents   Title:"
msgstr "Table of Contents   Taitol:"

#: temp.glade:37016
msgid "This will automatically generate the Table of Contents\n"
"for all the books included in the publication using one\n"
"or more of the \\toc1, \\toc2 and \\toc3 fields as specified.\n"
"The \\toc1, \\toc2 and \\toc3 choices are only applied\n"
"when \"Multiple Books\" is set on the Basic tab.\n"
"\n"
"NOTE: PTXprint typesets the text more than once\n"
"to get the page numbers right, so printing takes\n"
"longer. (With Quick Run on, click Print a second\n"
"time.) If Local Front Matter is on, put \\ztoc|main\\*\n"
"in the front matter where the ToC should appear."
msgstr "Dispela bai i wokim Table of Contents yet\n"
"bilong olgeta buk i stap long publication long usim\n"
"wanpela o moa bilong ol \\toc1, \\toc2 na \\toc3 field olsem yu makim.\n"
"Ol \\toc1, \\toc2 na \\toc3 i save wok tasol\n"
"sapos \"Multiple Books\" i stap long Basic tab.\n"
"\n"
"NOT: PTXprint i printim tekst planti taim\n"
"long kisim stretpela namba bilong pes, olsem na\n"
"printim i save kisim longpela taim. (Sapos Quick Run i on, klikim Print namba tu taim.)\n"
"Sapos Local Front Matter i on, putim \\ztoc|main\\*\n"
"long front matter long ples we yu laik ToC i kamap."

#: temp.glade:37046
msgid "The heading for the Table of Contents (for\n"
"example 'Contents' in your language). It can\n"
"also be used in the front matter as \\zvar|toctitle\\*"
msgstr "Hedim bilong Table of Contents (olsem\n"
"'Ol Samting Insait' long tok ples bilong yu). Yu ken\n"
"usim tu long front matter olsem \\zvar|toctitle\\*"

#: temp.glade:37051
msgid "Table of Contents Title"
msgstr "Taitol bilong Table of Contents"

#: temp.glade:37073 temp.glade:37130 temp.glade:37150
msgid "Select which of the \\toc markers\n"
"should be included in the\n"
"generated Table of Contents."
msgstr "Makim wanem ol \\toc marka\n"
"i mas stap insait long Table of Contents\n"
"weh bai ol i kamapim."

#: temp.glade:37186
msgid "To be listed\n"
"in the Table\n"
"of Contents"
msgstr "Bai i stap\n"
"long Table\n"
"of Contents"

#: temp.glade:37205
msgid "Leaders:"
msgstr "Leaders:"

#: temp.glade:37219
msgid "Leaders display dots or a line between\n"
"the text and the page number. Select\n"
"the style of leader you wish to apply."
msgstr "Leaders i soim ol dot o wanpela lain namel\n"
"long tekst na namba bilong pes. Makim\n"
"stail bilong leader yu laik usim."

#: temp.glade:37244
msgid "Use Peripheral Introductory Sections"
msgstr "Usim Peripheral Introductory Sections"

#: temp.glade:37249
msgid "Check this option if the INT book contains \n"
"peripheral divisions (sub-sections) which \n"
"need to be inserted at the appropriate position\n"
"between books. For example:\n"
"  \\periph Old Testament Introduction|id=\"intot\"\n"
"  \\periph New Testament Introduction|id=\"intnt\"\n"
"  \\periph Gospels Introduction|id=\"intgospels\""
msgstr "Makim dispela sapos buk INT i garim ol peripheral\n"
"division (sub-section) we i mas go long stret ples\n"
"namel long ol buk. Olsem:\n"
"  \\periph Old Testament Introduction|id=\"intot\"\n"
"  \\periph New Testament Introduction|id=\"intnt\"\n"
"  \\periph Gospels Introduction|id=\"intgospels\""

#: temp.glade:37279
msgid "Local Front Matter"
msgstr "Local Front Matter"

#: temp.glade:37285
msgid "PTXprint does not directly typeset the FRT\n"
"book from Paratext. Instead, it uses a \"local\"\n"
"PTXprint-specific copy of Paratext's FRT book \n"
"which can be enhanced by additional codes\n"
"which are described on the View+Edit tab's\n"
"Information button.\n"
"\n"
"Note: turning this on turns the Colophon off\n"
"(you can turn it on again). A cover needs\n"
"Local Front Matter."
msgstr "PTXprint i no printim stret FRT buk\n"
"bilong Paratext. Em i usim wanpela \"local\"\n"
"kopi bilong FRT buk bilong Paratext i bilong\n"
"PTXprint tasol, na yu ken putim ol narapela kod\n"
"long en. Ol kod i stap long Information boton\n"
"bilong View+Edit tab.\n"
"\n"
"Not: sapos yu onim dispela, Colophon bai i\n"
"of (yu ken onim gen). Wanpela kava i mas gat\n"
"Local Front Matter."

#: temp.glade:37327
msgid "Force Page Break \n"
"at each Periph"
msgstr "Mekim Page Break \n"
"long olgeta Periph"

#: temp.glade:37333
msgid "This option is normally checked so that each\n"
"different section of the front matter will begin\n"
"on a new page."
msgstr "Dispela i save stap makim, olsem na olgeta\n"
"kain kain hap bilong front matter bai i stat\n"
"long nupela pes."

#: temp.glade:37351
msgid "Suppress Blank Page\n"
"Before Scripture Text"
msgstr "Rausim Blank Pes\n"
"Bipo long Skripsa Tekst"

#: temp.glade:37357
msgid "By default, the main body of scripture always starts\n"
"on an odd (right-hand-side) page. PTXprint will\n"
"automatically insert a pagebreak if needed to make\n"
"this happen. If you wish to override this behavior,\n"
"then check this option (to NOT insert a blank page\n"
"after any front matter material)."
msgstr "Olsem oltaim, bikpela hap bilong Skripsa i stat\n"
"long odd pes (right-hand-side). PTXprint bai\n"
"putim wanpela pagebreak yet sapos i gat nid long\n"
"mekim olsem. Sapos yu laik senisim dispela pasin,\n"
"makim dispela (bai i no putim blank pes\n"
"bihain long ol front matter)."

#: temp.glade:37391
msgid "Include Maps"
msgstr "Putim ol Map"

#: temp.glade:37396
msgid "Add the map book (usually XXM) to the list\n"
"of books to print. Use Add Maps... to create\n"
"the map pages."
msgstr "Putim buk bilong map (olgeta XXM) long lista\n"
"bilong ol buk bai yu printim. Usim Add Maps...\n"
"long wokim ol pes bilong map."

#: temp.glade:37482
msgid "Enter your Colophon text here - using standard\n"
"USFM codes for formatting. You may want to\n"
"use the reset button to start with a standard set.\n"
"\n"
"You can use the following codes to\n"
"automatically include special text \n"
"using the following markers:\n"
"\\zcopyright   - copyright statement from the Basic tab\n"
"\\zlicense     - License text from the Basic tab\n"
"\\zimagecopyrights   - Automatically generated list of images, page numbers and attributions.\n"
"\\zimagecopyrightsfr - as above, but use localized (fr = French) version (es, fr, hu, id, pt, ro available).\n"
"\n"
"\\b can be used to insert a blank line between markers if needed.\n"
"\n"
"If using a Left-to-Right script for the colophon in a RTL publication\n"
"you will need to add \\beginL to force the colophon to render LTR.\n"
"For example:\n"
"   \\pc \\beginL \\zcopyright\n"
"   \\pc \\beginL \\zlicense\n"
"   \\pc \\beginL \\zimagecopyrights\n"
"\n"
"These special codes may also be used in other\n"
"books such as the front matter book (FRT). \n"
"\n"
"IMPORTANT: You will have to click Print a second time\n"
"in order to get accurate Image Copyright Attribution."
msgstr "Raitim tekst bilong Colophon bilong yu long hia - usim\n"
"ol standet USFM kod long fomat. Maski yu laik\n"
"usim reset boton long statim wantaim wanpela standet set.\n"
"\n"
"Yu ken usim ol dispela kod long putim\n"
"spesel tekst yet long usim ol dispela marka:\n"
"\\zcopyright   - copyright statement i stap long Basic tab\n"
"\\zlicense     - License tekst i stap long Basic tab\n"
"\\zimagecopyrights   - Lista bilong ol piksa, namba bilong pes na ol nem i kamap yet.\n"
"\\zimagecopyrightsfr - olsem antap, tasol usim local (fr = Frens) version (es, fr, hu, id, pt, ro i stap).\n"
"\n"
"\\b i ken putim wanpela blank lain namel long ol marka sapos i gat bikpela nid.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu usim wanpela Left-to-Right script long colophon long wanpela RTL publication\n"
"yu mas putim \\beginL long strongim colophon long kamap LTR.\n"
"Olsem:\n"
"   \\pc \\beginL \\zcopyright\n"
"   \\pc \\beginL \\zlicense\n"
"   \\pc \\beginL \\zimagecopyrights\n"
"\n"
"Ol dispela spesel kod i ken wok tu long ol narapela\n"
"buk olsem front matter buk (FRT).\n"
"\n"
"IMPOTAN: Yu mas klikim Print namba tu taim\n"
"long kisim stretpela Image Copyright Attribution."

#: temp.glade:37511
msgid "Colophon Text:"
msgstr "Colophon Tekst:"

#: temp.glade:37541
msgid "Note: There are several shortcuts you can use:\n"
"   (c) --> ©  the copyright sign\n"
"   (r) --> ®  to denote registered trademarks\n"
"   (tm) --> ™  to denote trademarks in general\n"
"\n"
"Other special codes converted at print time:\n"
"use ~ for places where a non-breaking space is needed\n"
"use // where a line break needs to be forced\n"
"but :// used in URLs will still be preserved"
msgstr "Not: I gat sampela shortcut yu ken usim:\n"
"   (c) --> ©  mak bilong copyright\n"
"   (r) --> ®  long makim registered trademark\n"
"   (tm) --> ™  long makim trademark long olgeta\n"
"\n"
"Ol narapela spesel kod i senis long taim bilong print:\n"
"usim ~ long ples we i nid long non-breaking space\n"
"usim // long ples we i mas bruim lain\n"
"but :// long ol URL bai i stap yet"

#: temp.glade:37570
msgid "Clicking this button will reload the \n"
"default Colophon text markers which\n"
"include the Copyright statement tag,\n"
"the License statement tag, and the\n"
"Illustration credits tag. Your current\n"
"colophon text will be replaced."
msgstr "Sapos yu klikim dispela boton, bai i kisim gen\n"
"ol default Colophon tekst marka. Ol i gat\n"
"Copyright statement tag, License statement tag,\n"
"na Illustration credits tag. Tekst bilong\n"
"Colophon yu gat nau bai i senis."

#: temp.glade:37594
msgid "Force Page Break \n"
"Before Colophon"
msgstr "Mekim Page Break \n"
"Bipo long Colophon"

#: temp.glade:37601
msgid "Normally the colophon is inserted at the end\n"
"of the last page of the last book. If this option\n"
"is checked, then the colophon will appear at the \n"
"bottom of a new page at the end of the publication.\n"
"\n"
"In Diglot publications, the colophon always appears\n"
"on its own page - regardless of this setting. "
msgstr "Olsem oltaim colophon i go long pinis bilong\n"
"las pes bilong las buk. Sapos dispela i makim,\n"
"bai colophon i kamap long as bilong nupela pes\n"
"long pinis bilong publikesen.\n"
"\n"
"Long ol Diglot publikesen, colophon i save kamap\n"
"long wanpela pes bilong em yet - maski dispela seting i olsem wanem. "

#: temp.glade:37622
msgid "Colophon at End of Publication"
msgstr "Colophon long Pinis bilong Publikesen"

#: temp.glade:37627
msgid "What is a Colophon?\n"
"A brief statement containing information\n"
"about the publication such as the place of \n"
"publication, the publisher, and the date of \n"
"publication. This will be printed at the END\n"
"of the book. Similar to a \"biblio-page\" or a\n"
"\"copyright-page\" at the front of a book.\n"
"\n"
"NOTE: The picture credits (\\zimagecopyrights)\n"
"are only correct after you click Print a\n"
"second time."
msgstr "Wanem samting Colophon i stap?\n"
"Sotpela tok i gat save long publication olsem\n"
"ples bilong printim, man bilong printim, na\n"
"dei bilong printim. Bai ol i printim long as\n"
"bilong buk (LAST). I olsem \"biblio-page\" o\n"
"\"copyright-page\" long pes bilong buk.\n"
"\n"
"NOT: Ol kredit bilong piksa (\\zimagecopyrights)\n"
"i stret tasol bihain long yu klikim Print\n"
"namba tu taim."

#: temp.glade:37666
msgid "Back Matter PDF(s)"
msgstr "Back Matter PDF"

#: temp.glade:37672
msgid "One or more previously created PDF file(s) can be included\n"
"AFTER the scripture material being typeset. If more than one\n"
"file is selected, then these will appear in alphabetical order."
msgstr "Wanpela o moa PDF fail ol i bin mekim bipo inap i go\n"
"BIHAIN long Skripsa tekst ol i printim. Sapos yu makim\n"
"moa long wanpela fail, ol bai i kamap long alfabet orda."

#: temp.glade:37747
msgid "Clicking this button will rescan the\n"
"Front Matter for any \\zvar|variables\\*\n"
"and add any that are missing to this\n"
"table of variable names and values."
msgstr "Klikim dispela boton long skanim gen\n"
"Front Matter long painim ol \\zvar|variables\\*\n"
"na putim ol i no stap yet long dispela\n"
"tebol bilong nem na velyu bilong variable."

#: temp.glade:37805
msgid "Pub"
msgstr "Pub"

#: temp.glade:37876
msgid "This table lists the standard set of \\zvar|variables\\* which\n"
"can be used as part of front matter and/or colophon. \n"
"As these \\zvar|variables\\* are customizable, you can\n"
"add your own as needed. For example, you may\n"
"need the \\zvar|maintitle\\* in more than one language\n"
"so you can add 'fr' or 'es' to create a new one:\n"
"  \\zvar|maintitlefr\\*\n"
"or you might want to add a custom variable such as:\n"
"   \\zvar|printedby\\*\n"
"\n"
"The values of these variables are saved with the config \n"
"as they might vary from one publication to another."
msgstr "Dispela tebol i soim ol standet \\zvar|variables\\* we\n"
"yu ken usim long front matter na/o colophon.\n"
"Ol dispela \\zvar|variables\\* i ken senis, olsem na yu ken\n"
"putim bilong yu yet. Olsem, yu ken nidim\n"
"\\zvar|maintitle\\* long moa long wanpela tokples,\n"
"olsem na yu ken putim 'fr' o 'es' long mekim nupela:\n"
"  \\zvar|maintitlefr\\*\n"
"o yu ken putim wanpela variable bilong yu olsem:\n"
"   \\zvar|printedby\\*\n"
"\n"
"Ol velyu bilong ol dispela variable i stap long config\n"
"bilong em, long wanem, i ken senis long wanpela\n"
"publikesen na narapela."

#: temp.glade:37890
msgid "Variables and Values:"
msgstr "Ol Variable na Velyu:"

#: temp.glade:37921
msgid "Delete the currently\n"
"selected variable(s)."
msgstr "Rausim ol variable\n"
"yu makim pinis."

#: temp.glade:37941
msgid "Add a new variable."
msgstr "Putim wanpela nupela variable."

#: temp.glade:37974
msgid "Define what material should be\n"
"placed before and/or after the\n"
"main scripture pages."
msgstr "Makim wanem samting i go\n"
"bilong stap paslain na/o biihain\n"
"long ol main peis bilong Skripsa."

#: lib/ptxprint/gtkview.py:3068
msgid "Peripherals"
msgstr "Peripherals"

#: temp.glade:38001
msgid "<span size=\"large\"><b>Publications</b></span>"
msgstr "<span size=\"large\"><b>Ol Publikesen</b></span>"

#: temp.glade:38015
msgid "Each publication prints this configuration with its own set of books and its own values for the \\zvars marked 'Pub' on the Peripherals tab (such as the main title and subtitle). Tick the publications you want, then click 'Print Selected'. Click a publication name, its books, or a field value to change it. Books shown in red cannot be understood – hold the mouse over them to see why."
msgstr "Olgeta publication i printim dispela configuration wantaim ol buk bilong en yet na ol vaelyu bilong en yet bilong ol \\zvars i gat 'Pub' long Peripherals tab (olsem bikpela hedim na liklik hedim). Makim ol publication yu laik, na klikim 'Print Selected'. Klikim nem bilong publication, ol buk bilong en, o vaelyu bilong field long senisim. Ol buk i kamap retpela, kompiuta i no save long ol – putim maus antap long ol long lukim as bilong en."

#: temp.glade:38041
msgid "Add a new publication, filled in from\n"
"the current configuration: the books\n"
"chosen on the Basic tab, and the title,\n"
"subtitle and other publishable \\zvars\n"
"from the Peripherals tab."
msgstr "Putim wanpela nupela publikesen, i pulap\n"
"long configuration bilong nau: ol buk\n"
"yu makim long Basic tab, na taitol,\n"
"sabtaitol na ol narapela \\zvars i ken\n"
"kamap long Peripherals tab."

#: temp.glade:38056
msgid "Duplicate"
msgstr "Kopiim"

#: temp.glade:38061
msgid "Make a complete copy of the\n"
"highlighted publication,\n"
"named 'Copy of ...'\n"
"(Click a publication first.)"
msgstr "Kopiim olgeta bilong publication i\n"
"lait\n"
"na givim nem 'Copy of ...'\n"
"(Klikim wanpela publication pastaim.)"

#: temp.glade:38075
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Rausim"

#: temp.glade:38080
msgid "Delete the highlighted publication\n"
"(you will be asked to confirm).\n"
"(Click a publication first.)"
msgstr "Rausim publication i lait\n"
"(bai ol i askim yu long strongim).\n"
"(Klikim wanpela publication pastaim.)"

#: temp.glade:38107
msgid "Expand All"
msgstr "Opim Olgeta"

#: temp.glade:38111
msgid "Show the details of every publication."
msgstr "Soim ol detel bilong olgeta publikesen."

#: temp.glade:38122
msgid "Collapse All"
msgstr "Pasim Olgeta"

#: temp.glade:38126
msgid "Hide the details of every publication."
msgstr "Haidim ol detel bilong olgeta publikesen."

#: temp.glade:38182
msgid "Publication ID / Field"
msgstr "ID bilong Publikesen / Fil"

#: temp.glade:38198
msgid "Books / Value"
msgstr "Ol Buk / Veliu"

#: temp.glade:38243
msgid "Print Selected"
msgstr "Printim Ol Yu Makim"

#: temp.glade:38248
msgid "Save the configuration, then create a PDF\n"
"for each ticked publication (in the background).\n"
"The folder with the PDFs opens when they\n"
"are finished."
msgstr "Seivim configuration, na bihain wokim PDF\n"
"bilong olgeta publication yu makim (long baksait).\n"
"Folder i gat ol PDF bai i op taim ol i pinis."

#: temp.glade:38277
msgid "Define several publications (each with\n"
"its own books, titles and other variables)\n"
"from this one configuration, and print\n"
"them all in one go."
msgstr "Makim planti publication (wanpela wanpela\n"
"i gat ol buk, hedim na ol narapela variable bilong en)\n"
"long dispela wanpela configuration, na printim\n"
"olgeta wantaim."

#: temp.glade:38282
msgid "Publications"
msgstr "Ol Publikesen"

#: temp.glade:38327
msgid "Set parameters for the cover\n"
"of the publication."
msgstr "Putim ol seting bilong\n"
"kava bilong publikesen."

#: temp.glade:38375 temp.glade:38475
msgid "How many pages will be printed on\n"
"one side of the physical paper?\n"
"\n"
"For example, for an A5-sized booklet,\n"
"2 pages will fit on each side, making a\n"
"total of 4 pages on a single sheet."
msgstr "Hamas peis bai i kamap long\n"
"wanpela sait bilong pepa?\n"
"\n"
"Pela eksampel, long wanpela buklet\n"
"bilong A5, 2 peis i ken pas long\n"
"kain sait, olsem na 4 peis i stap\n"
"long wanpela sit."

#: temp.glade:38382
msgid "Pages Per Spread:"
msgstr "Peis long Wanpela Spred:"

#: temp.glade:38393
msgid "This is the actual size of the sheet of\n"
"paper on which multiple pages will\n"
"be printed. For example, if printing\n"
"an A5-sized booklet, the actual sheet\n"
"of paper that you print on will be\n"
"2x the A5-sized page, which is an\n"
"A4-sized sheet of paper."
msgstr "Dispela em i bikpela bilong sit bilong\n"
"pepa we planti peis bai i kamap long en.\n"
"Pela eksampel, sapos yu printim wanpela\n"
"buklet bilong A5, sit pepa yu printim long\n"
"en bai i 2 taim bikpela bilong A5 peis,\n"
"em i A4 sit pepa."

#: temp.glade:38402
msgid "Physical\n"
"Paper Size:"
msgstr "Bikpela bilong\n"
"Sit Pepa:"

#: temp.glade:38415 temp.glade:38548
msgid "A signature is a collection of pages folded\n"
"and bound together as a unit. A signature\n"
"may be made up of multiple sheets.\n"
"\n"
"If unsure, leave this setting at 0 to indicate\n"
"that the publication will not be bound \n"
"using separate signatures."
msgstr "Wanpela signecha em i ol peis ol i foldim\n"
"na bindim wantaim olsem wanpela. Wanpela\n"
"signecha i ken gat planti sit.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu no save, larim dispela seting i stap\n"
"long 0 bilong soim olsem ol i no inap bindim\n"
"buk long ol narapela narapela signecha."

#: temp.glade:38423
msgid "Sheets Per Signature:"
msgstr "Ol Sit long Wanpela Signecha:"

#: temp.glade:38435
msgid "If the required size is not displayed, then \n"
"just type the required page width and \n"
"height separated by a comma. \n"
"\n"
"For example: 203mm, 330mm (Foolscap)"
msgstr "Sapos bikpela yu laikim i no stap,\n"
"yu ken taipim wit na hait bilong peis\n"
"na putim komap namel long tupela.\n"
"\n"
"Pela eksampel: 203mm, 330mm (Foolscap)"

#: temp.glade:38506
msgid "Scale to fit"
msgstr "Skelim long fit"

#: temp.glade:38511
msgid "Only available when Pages per Spread is 1-up.\n"
"Enable this option to scale every page\n"
"(up or down) so that it fits the Physical\n"
"Paper Size (set on this tab), centred\n"
"on the sheet."
msgstr "I wok tasol taim Pages per Spread em 1-up.\n"
"Onim dispela long senisim bikpela bilong olgeta pes\n"
"(i go antap o daun) long fit long Physical\n"
"Paper Size (yu makim long dispela tab), na i stap long namel\n"
"bilong sit."

#: temp.glade:38529
msgid "The minimum width of the area to\n"
"be cut after folding of the signature.\n"
"Measured in millimeters (mm)."
msgstr "Liklik wit bilong hap ol i mas katim\n"
"bihain long foldim bilong signecha.\n"
"Ol i skelim long milimita (mm)."

#: temp.glade:38535
msgid "Fold Cut \n"
"Margin (mm):"
msgstr "Margin bilong\n"
"Kat long Fold (mm):"

#: temp.glade:38572
msgid "The minimum width of the area to be cut\n"
"after folding of the signature.\n"
"Measured in millimeters (mm)."
msgstr "Liklik bikpela bilong hap bai ol i katim\n"
"bihain long fold bilong signature.\n"
"Ol i kaunim long milimita (mm)."

#: temp.glade:38590
msgid "Fold First"
msgstr "Fold Pastaim"

#: temp.glade:38595
msgid "If you are imposing for a printer with a folding machine, \n"
"then you want to fold first and then cut. This, for example\n"
"makes a folded sheet that is part of a signature consist of\n"
"two sets of sequential pages."
msgstr "Sapos yu makim ol pes bilong printa i gat masin bilong fold, orait yu laik fold pastaim na bihain katim. Olsem, wanpela sit i fold i stap insait long wanpela signature, em i kamap tupela hap pes i kisim namba i stret."

#: temp.glade:38609
msgid "Create Cover as \n"
"a Separate PDF"
msgstr "Kamapim Kava olsem\n"
"Wanpela Narapela PDF"

#: temp.glade:38616
msgid "This option is only available if Create Cover is\n"
"enabled on the Cover tab. Enable this option if\n"
"you plan to print the outer (wrapper) cover\n"
"separately from the book's content. This is often\n"
"the case if cardstock, or a colour cover is used."
msgstr "Dispela opsen i save wok sapos Kamapim Kava i op long tab Kava. Yusim dispela opsen sapos yu laik printim kava bilong ausait (wrapper) i narapela long ol pes insait bilong buk. Ol i save mekim olsem sapos ol i yusim kardstok, o kava i gat kala."

#: temp.glade:38640
msgid "Whether you need a simple booklet\n"
"or a more complex signature, these\n"
"options allow plenty of scope."
msgstr "Sapos yu laik wanpela liklik buk o wanpela signature i hatwok moa, ol dispela opsen i ken helpim yu long olgeta samting."

#: temp.glade:38643
msgid "Booklet Pagination"
msgstr "Pagination bilong Liklik Buk"

#: lib/ptxprint/gtkview.py:5583 lib/ptxprint/gtkview.py:5603 lib/ptxprint/gtkview.py:5621 lib/ptxprint/runjob.py:871
msgid "Previous PDF (_1)"
msgstr "Pastaim PDF (_1)"

#: temp.glade:38715
msgid "Only Show Pages\n"
"With Differences"
msgstr "Soim Ol Pes Tasol\n"
"I Gat Senis"

#: temp.glade:38721
msgid "When comparing two PDF files the\n"
"resulting \"Diff\" PDF can get rather\n"
"large. This option reduces the size\n"
"of the PDF by not including any\n"
"identical pages. This also saves\n"
"time as you don't need to search\n"
"through a lengthy PDF to find\n"
"out what might have changed."
msgstr "Taim yu kompia tupela PDF fail, PDF \"Diff\" i kamap i ken bikpela tumas. Dispela opsen i mekim PDF i liklik moa, long wanem em i no putim ol pes i wankain. Em i save sevim taim tu, long wanem yu no needim painim long wanpela longpela PDF long save wanem samting i senis."

#: temp.glade:38747
msgid "Use this color to show anything\n"
"that has been added (or moved to\n"
"the current location) in the new PDF."
msgstr "Yusim dispela kala long soim olgeta samting ol i putim (o ol i muvim i kam long ples nau) long nupela PDF."

#: temp.glade:38752
msgid "Color to Highlight Differences"
msgstr "Kala long Soim Ol Senis"

#: temp.glade:38765 temp.glade:39021
msgid "Set the color to use when\n"
"differences are found between\n"
"the old and the new PDFs.\n"
"\n"
"Use this color to show anything\n"
"that has been added (or moved to\n"
"the current location) in the new PDF."
msgstr "Makim kala bilong yusim taim ol i painim ol senis namel long olpela PDF na nupela PDF.\n"
"\n"
"Yusim dispela kala long soim olgeta samting ol i putim (o ol i muvim i kam long ples nau) long nupela PDF."

#: temp.glade:38774
msgid "New Text"
msgstr "Nupela Tekst"

#: temp.glade:38786
msgid "Use this color to show anything\n"
"that has been deleted (or moved from\n"
"the previous location) in the old PDF."
msgstr "Yusim dispela kala long soim olgeta samting ol i rausim (o ol i muvim i go long ples bipo) long olpela PDF."

#: temp.glade:38808
msgid "Select a particular PDF file to be compared \n"
"against the current output PDF. If you just \n"
"want to compare output to the previous run,\n"
"then click Cancel in the File Open dialog\n"
"to reset the filename (which will then\n"
"default to _1)."
msgstr "Makim wanpela PDF fail bilong kompia wantaim PDF bilong nau. Sapos yu laik kompia tasol wantaim PDF bilong las taim, klikim Cancel long File Open dialog long senisim nem bilong fail (em bai i go bek long _1)."

#: temp.glade:38816
msgid "Compare With \n"
"a Previous PDF:"
msgstr "Kompia Wantaim\n"
"Olpela PDF:"

#: temp.glade:38833 temp.glade:38868
msgid "The PDF showing differences between the old\n"
"and the new contains images that make the\n"
"resulting file rather large. Use this option to\n"
"limit the number of \"Diff\" pages created.\n"
"This will also potentially speed up the process."
msgstr "PDF i soim ol senis namel long olpela na nupela i gat ol piksa, na dispela i mekim fail i kamap bikpela tumas. Yusim dispela opsen long limitim namba bilong ol pes \"Diff\" ol i kamapim. Em i ken mekim wok i go kwik moa tu."

#: temp.glade:38875
msgid "Show Max\n"
"Diff Pages:"
msgstr "Maksimum Namba\n"
"bilong Pes Diff:"

#: temp.glade:38892
msgid "Ignore When\n"
"Comparing:"
msgstr "Lusim Taim\n"
"Yu Komperim:"

#: temp.glade:38903
msgid "Headers + Footers"
msgstr "Header + Footer"

#: temp.glade:38908
msgid "Only compare the text area of each page, and\n"
"ignore the margins above and below it: running\n"
"headers, footers and page numbers.\n"
"\n"
"The ignored areas are shaded in the \"Diff\" PDF."
msgstr "Komperim tasol hap tekst bilong wanwan pes, na\n"
"lusim ol margin antap na daunbilo long en: ol running\n"
"header, footer na namba bilong pes.\n"
"\n"
"Ol hap mipela i lusim i gat sedo long \"Diff\" PDF."

#: temp.glade:38924
msgid "Side Margins"
msgstr "Sait Margin"

#: temp.glade:38929
msgid "Only compare the text area of each page, and\n"
"ignore the margins to the left and right of it:\n"
"margin notes and references, thumb tabs, etc.\n"
"\n"
"The ignored areas are shaded in the \"Diff\" PDF."
msgstr "Komperim tasol hap tekst bilong wanwan pes, na\n"
"lusim ol margin long left na rait bilong en:\n"
"ol margin not na reference, thumb tab, na ol narapela.\n"
"\n"
"Ol hap mipela i lusim i gat sedo long \"Diff\" PDF."

#: temp.glade:38950 temp.glade:39047
msgid "If the two PDFs do not start on the same page\n"
"(for example one has a cover or extra front\n"
"matter), then pages would be compared with the\n"
"wrong ones. Use this to line them up.\n"
"\n"
"A positive number skips that many pages at the\n"
"start of the older PDF. A negative number skips\n"
"that many pages at the start of the new PDF."
msgstr "Sapos tupela PDF i no stat long wankain pes\n"
"(olsem wanpela i gat kava o extra front\n"
"matter), orait ol pes bai i komperim long\n"
"ol pes i no stret. Usim dispela long lainim ol.\n"
"\n"
"Wanpela namba i plas i lusim planti pes olsem long\n"
"stat bilong PDF i olpela. Wanpela namba i minus i lusim\n"
"planti pes olsem long stat bilong nupela PDF."

#: temp.glade:38977
msgid "Smart Check"
msgstr "Smart Check"

#: temp.glade:38982
msgid "Compare the text, not where it sits on the page.\n"
"\n"
"Use this when the margins have been changed but the\n"
"text itself has not. For example, a binding gutter has\n"
"been added and the left and right margins reduced so\n"
"that the text block stays the same size. Or the top\n"
"margin has been increased and the bottom margin\n"
"reduced by the same amount.\n"
"\n"
"Normally everything on the page would show up as\n"
"different because it has all moved. With Smart Check,\n"
"each page of the old PDF is first moved to line up\n"
"with the new one (left and right pages can move in\n"
"opposite directions), so only real differences are\n"
"shown: changed wording, different line breaks, etc.\n"
"\n"
"If the text block has changed size then the lines\n"
"will wrap differently, and those differences are\n"
"still shown.\n"
"\n"
"Note: on a page that had to be moved, Smart Check is\n"
"a little less sensitive than a normal comparison, so\n"
"a very small change (such as one comma replacing a\n"
"full stop) might not be reported."
msgstr "Komperim tekst, i no hap em i sindaun long pes.\n"
"\n"
"Usim dispela taim yu senisim ol margin tasol tekst yet\n"
"i no senis. Olsem, yu putim wanpela binding gutter\n"
"na yu daunim ol margin long left na rait\n"
"bai bikpela bilong tekst blok i stap wankain. O yu\n"
"bikim top margin na daunim bottom margin\n"
"long wankain mak.\n"
"\n"
"Olgeta samting long pes bai i kamap\n"
"olsem i narapela, long wanem ol i muv pinis. Long Smart Check,\n"
"wanwan pes bilong olpela PDF i muv pastaim\n"
"long lain wantaim nupela (left na rait pes inap muv\n"
"long narapela narapela rot), olsem na ol stret\n"
"diferens tasol i kamap: ol tok i senis, ol lain brek i narapela, na ol narapela.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos bikpela bilong tekst blok i senis, orait ol lain\n"
"bai i wrap long narapela rot, na ol dispela diferens\n"
"bai i kamap yet.\n"
"\n"
